      "review_description": "I have used this company on 3 other installs, and returned out of loyalty, to find ethics are not the same.A 25 Panel system quoted, is now a 24 Panel system, with promised email, and face to face conversation of a refund of that one panel.The night of install completion, my aircon didn't work, i called the guy who installed the aircon, as thought was the air con was faulty, to find the wiring completed in this solar installation had the aircon wired through the hot water timer.Nothing checked or tested., as per Australian StandardsI declined their request to return to fix this, as i already had the aircon guy here, plus due to lack of confidence.Communication, and resolution is not their strong point, as they could have \" at least \" offered to pay half the aircon fix.Nothing now paid, they have declined me request of any refunds nowA  nasty phone call from them and they were frustrated, with a merry-go-round of aggressive attitude.An absolute circus, of stress, with big boots, on a newly painted tiled roof, ( Google footwear for walking on tiled roof) volleys are best or runners..Contesting a paying customer, with attitude, and smart alec comebacks... terrible customer relationsMy 4th and last time i use this company... never again",
