      "review_description": "When selling a solar system you must understand that the customer knows bugger all about how all this works just telling a customer to pick what they would like and you will install it doesn’t cut the mustard,The three solar companies you sent to us thought we were just easy pickings where they could just wonder in and tell us to pick what we wanted and they would install it.Uni industries came in and did a full comprehensive look at what we were using when we were using it and how our current system was setup i.e. night rate and off-peak then came back to us with a comprehensive quote on what we would need to be fulfil our energy needs in the future (good old fashion service)They even took down the old system for free, the installation process was fantastic, they even went above and beyond and fixed up a couple of issues in our power box and their team was very professional,Above all there good communication throughout every step of the process was fantastic.Installation also included a timer for the hot water system and also wireless communication and set up on my phone so I can see in real time what the solar is producing and we are using",
