      "review_description": "Couldn't be happier to have chosen Uni-Industries to trust with such a big investment.Their quotes were certainly the best bang for buck out there - good quality at a very good price.I was worried that it may have been a too-good-to-be-true case especially because they weren't one of the companies recommended from SolarQuotes.I was worried that maybe they'll cut corners in the installation or not assist me after the job was done - boy was I wrong.The whole process was flawless, from Sales and Admin, to Installation and Customer Service.They were extremely helpful in educating me on the process and answering all my questions. During installation they were very happy to answer all my questions and involve me in the process. The installation was also flawless.There was an issue with my smart meter but Uni-Industries were there and assisted me in getting it sorted with the manufacturer.I couldn't recommend them enough and I think that SolarQuotes should really consider adding them to their list :)",
